cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated article."
title: "Analysis pipeline for: Host genetics contributes to microbiome maturation trajectories and pathway-level function in swine"
abstract: >-
  Fourteen numbered R scripts plus a shared plotting theme, reproducing the per-animal microbiome maturation descriptors,
  pedigree-based animal-model heritability estimates, random-regression h2(t),
  feature-level heritability across taxonomic, gene and pathway aggregation, and all
  manuscript figures.
